}

docs {
  # Schedule Mentorship Session
  Book a 1-on-1 advisory session between a founder and an approved mentor.

  ### Authentication
  Bearer Token

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Founder
- Mentor
- Admin

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `201` - Session created and calendar invite dispatched.
  - `400` - Time conflict or missing params.

  ### Response Example (201)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "session": {
      "id": "ses_2",
      "topic": "Financial Model Review & INR Cash Runway",
      "status": "scheduled"
    }
  }
  ```
}
